<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="page">
    <h1>Image credits</h1>
    <p class="section-lead">
      Blue Harbour Aquarium is a fictional organisation created for an academic
      project. It has no premises and no photography of its own, so every image
      on this site is stock photography used under the terms of its licence.
      Credit is given below even where the licence does not require it.
    </p>

    <section aria-labelledby="licence-heading">
      <h2 id="licence-heading">Licensing</h2>
      <p>
        All photographs are sourced from <a href="https://www.pexels.com">Pexels</a>
        and used under the Pexels licence, which permits free use for commercial and
        non-commercial purposes without attribution. Attribution is provided here
        regardless, as crediting the photographer is a reasonable courtesy even when
        it is not a legal requirement.
      </p>
      <p>
        No images have been used that depict identifiable people, and none have been
        taken from another aquarium&rsquo;s website or marketing material.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="photographs-heading">
      <h2 id="photographs-heading">Photographs</h2>
      <ul class="credit-list">
        <% zones.forEach(zone => { %>
          <li class="credit">
            <img class="credit__thumb"
                 src="/images/<%= zone.image_file %>"
                 alt=""
                 loading="lazy"
                 width="160" height="120">
            <div>
              <p class="credit__usage"><%= zone.name %></p>
              <p class="credit__source"><%= zone.image_credit %></p>
            </div>
          </li>
        <% }) %>
        <li class="credit">
          <img class="credit__thumb" src="/images/hero.jpg" alt=""
               loading="lazy" width="160" height="120">
          <div>
            <p class="credit__usage">Homepage banner</p>
            <p class="credit__source">Photo by Fernando B.M. from Pexels</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="content-heading">
      <h2 id="content-heading">Written content</h2>
      <p>
        All written content on this site is original and was written for this project.
        Conservation figures and programme descriptions are illustrative examples for a
        fictional organisation, not claims about any real aquarium.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>